\section{Introduction}
NekoTeX adds semantic, reusable content elements on top of LaTeX.
\note{A document can contain rich \textbf{notes}.}
\callout[Important]{This is a labeled callout.}
\tip{You can still use \emph{ordinary LaTeX} commands.}
\codeblock[python]{def hello(): print("Hello from MetaTeX")}
